  "notes": "City of Valley, FYE 9/30/2023. Governmental funds cash basis (p3-4, Total Governmental column); proprietary funds accrual (p5-7, Total column: Utilities + Nursing Home), business_type measure net position with printed prior period adjustment (335,394). Taxes 7,371,041 split into Sales 1,790,323 (Statement of Activities p2 = Sales Tax fund column) and property tax 5,580,718 (remainder; SoA prints taxes only as Property, which includes special assessments 10,855, and Sales). Other financing (p4): sale of property 100,536 and Tax increment financing (3,465,418) printed under Other Financing Sources -> other_financing -3,364,882. Transfers out 1,196,000 to proprietary funds (business_type transfers_net +1,196,000). Governmental prior period adjustment (1,680,975) in adjustments. Ending fund balance 7,637,821 as printed on p4 (includes internal balances 1,758,036; Balance Sheet p3 total fund balance 5,879,785). Beginning cash not printed. Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position p1 (governmental funds statement differs by internal balances), lines by Governmental / Business-type column, totals from Total column. Proprietary statement of net position p5 differs slightly from p1 (buildings 941,040 vs 941,042, infrastructure 17,309,270 vs 17,309,267, accumulated depreciation 8,960,834 vs 8,960,833); p1 used. Detail: governmental budget schedule p8 covers all governmental funds except the Debt Service (Bond) fund, recorded as one combined schedule as printed; Debt Service Fund schedule p9; business-type detail from the combined Proprietary Funds budget schedule p10 (budget basis), as FY2024. ending_cash = Cash and cash equivalents 5,789,590 (p3); cash with County Treasurer 90,195 separate (as FY2024). Read pages 1-10 of 10"
